WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.360
- Well, speaking of meeting cool people...

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:04.170
So I heard you met Prince,
and we have this thing on this

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.003
show.

00:00:05.003 --> 00:00:06.670
Everybody has a Prince story.
- Yeah.

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.141
I don't, but everybody else does.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:09.000
(all laughs)

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.870
And, and it's,

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:12.440
I want to know, like,
what was your experience.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.060
- My Prince story is that I got a meeting,

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.000
like a general meeting to
go meet with this director.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.880
And they said, "and Prince",

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.860
and I thought like Prince
Johnson from Santa Monica or

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:20.693
something.

00:00:20.693 --> 00:00:21.526
(audience laughs)
- And so--

00:00:21.526 --> 00:00:22.670
- Oh, you didn't know
it was actually Prince

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:23.747
that you were seeing?

00:00:23.747 --> 00:00:24.580
- I had no idea.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.413
- Oh, that makes me sweat.

00:00:25.413 --> 00:00:26.246
- So, me too.

00:00:26.246 --> 00:00:27.079
- Yeah.
- Even now.

00:00:27.079 --> 00:00:28.880
- And so I rescheduled the meeting twice

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.019
cause I had a bunch of stuff going on.

00:00:31.019 --> 00:00:32.824
- You rescheduled on Prince?

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:34.150
- I know! (all laughs)

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:35.127
- So the last time they were like,

00:00:35.127 --> 00:00:36.150
"You're either coming or you're not."

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.920
And I was like, "Okay, I'm coming."

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.960
So that I come to this
meeting at this house.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.450
And as soon as I get on the
elevator that's in the house.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.200
I'm like, "What is an
elevator in a house?"

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.950
The doors open and it's
crushed purple velvet.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:49.050
And I'm like, "Wait, wait,
wait, wait, wait, wait."

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:51.820
And so I look back at the
director, I'm like, "I'm fine."

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:52.653
- I'm fine. (laughs)

00:00:52.653 --> 00:00:54.690
- And then the door closes
and the emblem's right there.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.910
And I was like, I'm flipping out.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:59.080
Like I'm such a Prince fan, so--

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:01.195
- Everyone is.
- When I tell you--

00:01:01.195 --> 00:01:02.028
- I would be sweating so much.

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:03.320
- You just figured that out
right before you met him?

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:04.920
- I did not know what to do with myself.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:05.753
- Oh no.

00:01:05.753 --> 00:01:07.387
- So then he comes out of
the hallway and she's like,

00:01:07.387 --> 00:01:08.470
"Prince, Megan's here."

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:10.190
And I'm like, "What?"

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:11.230
So he comes around the hallway,

00:01:11.230 --> 00:01:12.740
he has these little Chinese pajamas,

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:14.170
and he has on like these
3 inch heels. (all laughs)

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.280
And his hairs tied up, he's got
his powder and his eyeliner.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.100
And he was like, "Would
you like something to eat?"

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:21.060
And I was like, "Yes, yes."

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:22.420
Mind you I just eaten.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.258
(laughs)

00:01:23.258 --> 00:01:24.091
And so we go,

00:01:24.091 --> 00:01:26.967
we sit down and we're sitting
at the table and he's like,

00:01:26.967 --> 00:01:29.240
"Do you want salad?" And I was
like, "I would love salad."

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:30.260
I hate salad.

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:31.930
Now, I'm better.
- I love salad though.

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:32.763
- Now I do.

00:01:32.763 --> 00:01:33.990
But back then I was like, "Yes."

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:34.823
And then he was like, "Okay."

00:01:34.823 --> 00:01:36.030
And then the person was like, "Well,

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:37.410
do you want salad, Prince?"
And he was like, "No."

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:38.730
I was like, "I don't want either."

00:01:38.730 --> 00:01:40.670
And then it just sounded
like I was like copying him.

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:41.720
I was like, "No, but I really don't.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:43.628
I don't really eat salad
that much. It's okay."

00:01:43.628 --> 00:01:44.461
(laughs)

00:01:44.461 --> 00:01:47.620
And then they brought out wine
and literally as the woman's

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:48.770
walking back in the kitchen,

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:50.280
Prince was like, (clears throat)

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:51.540
and she was like, "Oh,
I'm sorry, I forgot."

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:53.456
She comes back out with a bright,

00:01:53.456 --> 00:01:55.310
bright green straw,

00:01:55.310 --> 00:01:57.820
like a child's straw and folds
it over for him and puts it

00:01:57.820 --> 00:01:59.050
in his red wine.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.420
And I was just like, okay.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:03.100
And I'm just watching like
everything and like the tables

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:03.933
long.

00:02:03.933 --> 00:02:05.140
And he's at the head of it
and me and the director at the

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:05.973
other side.

00:02:05.973 --> 00:02:08.730
And I looked down and I can
see his feet are about this far

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.563
from the ground.

00:02:09.563 --> 00:02:10.862
I can see him kind of going like that.

00:02:10.862 --> 00:02:11.695
(audience laughs)

00:02:11.695 --> 00:02:12.528
And then like,

00:02:12.528 --> 00:02:13.580
he was like making little
shapes on the table.

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:14.770
It was the awkwardest dinner,

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:17.830
and I had no idea why I was
there and what was going on.

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.537
And then by the end of it, he was like,

00:02:19.537 --> 00:02:21.900
"I want to make this documentary
about a young Malcolm X,

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:23.770
and I want you to play the
character and I want to show it

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:25.740
to you." And I was like, "Oh, okay."

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.350
So then we watched a little
bit documentary, then I left.

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:30.470
And then I pulled down the
street and I called my mom.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:31.660
I was like, "Mom (inaudible)."

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.333
I'm screaming.

00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:34.860
And then I like literally
was like, "Can you hear me?"

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:35.760
And she was like, "What happened?

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.920
Did you get a car accident?
I can't understand you."

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:38.753
- Oh no!

00:02:38.753 --> 00:02:39.586
- And I was like,

00:02:39.586 --> 00:02:41.170
"No, I'm trying to say
that I just met Prince.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.380
And so yeah.

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:43.813
Best, best day ever.

00:02:43.813 --> 00:02:44.701
- Can I--

00:02:44.701 --> 00:02:48.552
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:02:48.552 --> 00:02:51.890
Can I, can I tell you that
I'm actually still back

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.954
where he asked for bright green straw?

00:02:53.954 --> 00:02:54.787
- Yeah.

00:02:54.787 --> 00:02:55.620
- With wine.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:58.131
- Yeah, I was like, "Maybe he's
a germophobe, I don't know."

00:02:58.131 --> 00:02:59.690
I was, I was trying to put it together.

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:00.930
- That's amazing.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.250
- I would, I'm like so weird.

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:03.860
I wouldn't have been able to let that go.

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:06.420
The whole dinner I'd
have been like, "Why?"

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:08.330
I probably would've had to ask him.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:09.830
That's why I've never met Prince.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.420
He knew, he knew.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.440
Don't invite that weirdo to my house.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:14.273
Have you ever met Prince?

00:03:14.273 --> 00:03:15.106
Did you ever meet him?

00:03:15.106 --> 00:03:15.939
- No.

00:03:15.939 --> 00:03:17.680
- Okay yeah, we don't have cool stories.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.270
Yeah, I'm not cool either.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:22.180
You know, I was like,
everyone has one, it's crazy.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.140
- Oh, I have a Prince story,

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.250
but it doesn't involve meeting him.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.160
- Oh wait, I want to
know the Prince story.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.440
- Do you remember those little records?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.373
They were like 33 and a
thirds back in the day.

00:03:28.373 --> 00:03:29.206
- Yeah.

00:03:29.206 --> 00:03:31.010
- So they used to give those
out at bar mitzvah parties.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.664
Like if you won the limbo contest.

00:03:32.664 --> 00:03:33.843
(audience laughing)

00:03:33.843 --> 00:03:34.676
- I was 10 years old.

00:03:34.676 --> 00:03:35.570
It was like my older,

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.150
it was my older brother's
friend's bar mitzvah.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:40.450
And that was the prize
was Erotic City on 33.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.920
Now, if you've listened to Erotic--

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:42.753
- What?

00:03:42.753 --> 00:03:44.317
- not appropriate for a ten-year-old.

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:46.936
That's my Prince story.

00:03:46.936 --> 00:03:48.154
(all laughs)

00:03:48.154 --> 00:03:49.938
- I love that they gave that out.

00:03:49.938 --> 00:03:53.310
(audience clapping)

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.666
Y'all know how to party.

00:03:55.666 --> 00:03:56.499
Just saying.

00:03:56.499 --> 00:03:57.446
- I was a really good limbo person.

00:03:57.446 --> 00:03:58.279
- Yeah, yeah. (laughs)

00:03:58.279 --> 00:04:00.000
Limbo and some Prince, I love it.

